sequenceDiagram
  participant Operator
  participant ZK as ZooKeeper Ensemble
  participant Broker as Kafka Brokers
  participant Controller as KRaft Controllers
  participant Client as Clients

  Operator->>Broker: Run pre-checks
  Broker->>ZK: Read source metadata
  Operator->>Controller: Start controllers in migration mode
  Controller->>ZK: Import metadata
  Operator->>Broker: Roll brokers with migration flags
  Client->>Broker: Continue produce/consume
  Operator->>Broker: Verify topics, ACLs, ISR, client traffic
  Operator->>Broker: Finalize KRaft broker mode
  Broker->>Controller: Use KRaft metadata quorum
  Operator->>ZK: Stop after acceptance window

